    "notes": [
      "Requires xdm_android_uix_r2_flat_dark_adaptive_shell_overlay.zip as its direct baseline.",
      "Downloads exposes Active, Queued, Finished, and All filters, compact live metrics, contextual queue notices, explicit search, flat rows, long-press selection, and adaptive list-detail presentation.",
