      "Add uses Review download followed by Add to queue; external handoffs remain review-first and Inspect media never creates a transfer automatically.",
      "Room schema 14, versionName 0.20.0-rc08, versionCode 21, routes, engines, queue policy, scheduler, recovery, external handoff, and developer diagnostics are unchanged.",
      "UIX R4 is the next overlay and redesigns Media and Library."
